<title>USA: Arbatax unit to buy 60 pct of PDG.</title>
<headline>Arbatax unit to buy 60 pct of PDG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arbatax International Inc said on Thursday that its subsidiary, CVD Financial Corp, will acquire about 60 percent of the common shares of PDG Remediation Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction is conditional on PDG Remediation's reincorporation in Delaware on or before November 1, the company said.</p>
<p>PDG is an environmental remediation company based in Pittsburgh, Pa. Its shares were owned by Environmental Services and were offered to CVD as a partial settlement of debts, the company said.</p>
</text>
